OL,3,GNEWSARoyals to visit Aberfan to mark 60
OL,4,Ayears since disaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles III, Queen Camilla and the
OL,7,FPrince of Wales will be among the
OL,8,Fvisitors to Aberfan on Wednesday to
OL,9,Fmark 60 years since the coal waste tip
OL,10,Fcollapse in the former mining village
OL,11,Fthat killed 144 children and adults.
OL,13,FA prayer and moment of silence will
OL,14,Ftake place and a male voice choir
OL,15,Fformed after the disaster is set to
OL,16,Fperform.
OL,18,FThe royals will also join survivors,
OL,19,Fbereaved parents and other members of
OL,20,Fthe community to mark the anniversary,
OL,21,Fwho will share their personal
OL,22,Freflections.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
