OL,3,GNEWSARoyals to visit Aberfan to mark 60
OL,4,Ayears since disaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn 21 October 1966, 116 children and 28
OL,7,Fadults were killed when the colliery
OL,8,Fspoil tip collapsed and engulfed a
OL,9,Fprimary school and surrounding houses.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
